From: BoilThis <34217932+BoilThis@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 16:11:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: enlarge Mount Caldera and contain the waterways

Move the stratovolcano to the western coast, raise the crest to 168m with a dark scoria rim, and retie the lava tube and ash trail to the new cone. Seal cave mouths to a thin doorway so the hillside no longer reads as a hole, and smooth branch forks. Keep lakes, the valley pond, and river ribbons inside their banks instead of sheeting over the gorges.
